* How Morpho works
** Morpho Blue markets
*** Loan, collateral, oracle, IRM, LLTV
*** id = keccak256(params)
*** Shares with virtual offset
*** Immutable singleton
** AdaptiveCurveIRM
*** Target utilisation 90%
*** Curve x4 above, /4 below
*** Rate at target drifts 50/year
** Liquidations
*** Unhealthy when debt > collateral x LLTV
*** LIF = min(1.15, 1/(0.3 LLTV + 0.7))
*** Bad debt cut from supply
** Oracle
*** price() scaled by 1e36
*** MorphoChainlinkOracleV2
*** Vault rate x feeds, no staleness check
left side
** Vault V1 (MetaMorpho)
*** Supply and withdraw queues
*** One cap per market
*** Guardian, one timelock
** Vault V2
*** Adapters
*** Owner, curator, allocator, sentinel
*** Absolute and relative caps by id
*** Timelocks, abdication, gates
*** forceDeallocate exit
*** Public allocator
